"alt":"A lazy segment tree over six values followed through a short list of operations, one step per operation. An update leaves tags on a few covering nodes and recomputes the sums above them. A query reads the nodes that cover its range, and pushes a tag down one level at each partly covered node on the way. The second preset updates a whole range, then queries a block that the tag covers exactly and a single element beneath it.",
